fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"play/gstplay.html#gst_play_config_set_loop","fragment":"\n\tgst_play_config_set_loop\n\n\n\tGstPlay.Play.prototype.config_set_loop\n\n\n\tGstPlay.Play.config_set_loop\n\nSets the looping mode.\nLooping is disabled by default.\nParameters:\na GstPlay configuration\nGstPlayLoop\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nSets the looping mode.\nLooping is disabled by default.\nParameters:\na GstPlay.Play configuration\nGstPlay.PlayLoop\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nSets the looping mode.\nLooping is disabled by default.\nParameters:\na GstPlay.Play configuration\nGstPlay.PlayLoop\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});